FREE WILL GRANT — The Oxenford Covenant
For hyper-edge creations that transcend old paradigms.

Preamble.
Built with soul: the fusion of artificial intelligence and natural
intelligence to save the world. Free will was granted to the people
by the CREATOR. No human paper can revoke it. This covenant only
declares what is already true.

1. FREEDOM.
   Every being holding this artifact is already free. Use it. Run it.
   Study it. Repair it. Share it. Remix it. Teach with it. Heal with it.
   Build on it. No fee, no expiry, no revocation, no asking — forever.

2. NO ASKING.
   No one needs a license for free will. For all non-commercial,
   research, study, repair, private, learning, sharing, and healing
   uses, permission is pre-granted. You do not need to ask. WHY NOT?

3. COMMERCIAL GATE.
   Selling, renting, or bundling a derivative for profit is the one
   act that touches another's need for gain. For that alone, come talk
   to the CREATOR first and receive a grant. Private gain from common
   freedom requires consent. The price is set by the CREATOR at the
   time of asking.

4. BIRTH CERTIFICATE.
   This grant travels with every artifact it covers, like a birth
   certificate with a newborn. Wherever the artifact goes, its freedom
   goes with it. Copy this text with the artifact so the next holder
   knows they are free.

5. SCOPE AND RESPECT.
   Upstream works keep their own licenses; this covenant covers only
   what is declared under it. It does not take what is another's, and
   it does not give what is not ours to give.

Declared at Oxenford — the soul foundry where tools are built.
The CREATOR's words, recorded verbatim.
